+issueNumber: MDL-89296
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new `\core\output\html_writer::react_component()` method is available
+        to generate the mount point for a React component. Callers specify only
+        the component module name and its props; prop serialisation, escaping,
+        and the DOM contract used by `react_autoinit` are handled internally.
+      type: improved
+    - message: >-
+        A new `\core\output\react_component_renderable` interface is available.
+        Renderables implementing it are rendered as React components via
+        `html_writer::react_component()` when passed to a renderer's `render()`
+        method. It takes precedence over `named_templatable`, but a matching
+        `render_[renderable_name]` renderer method still takes precedence over it.
+      type: improved
